    "content": "Minn. R. 5200.0030\n\nSubpart 1. Rates. The minimum wage rates established under Minnesota Statutes, section 177.24, apply to employees covered by the Minnesota Fair Labor Standards Act.",
    "sections": [{ "sectionRef": "5200.0030", "content": "Minnesota administrative minimum wage rates track Minn. Stat. § 177.24 for covered employees." }],
